{"id":"msg_m_ex_n102_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_n102","label":"N102 · Nikke"},"label":"7. Hello,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_03","next":"msg_m_ex_n102_05","speakers":{"n102":"N102"},"icons":{"n102":"si_c120_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_1","text":"Hello,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_2","text":"Teacher.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_3","text":"Hello, Anne.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_4","text":"Loads of people approached me today,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_5","text":"but I couldn't remember their names,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_6","text":"so I just stood there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_7","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_8","text":"Memorizing names is so hard T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_9","text":"If I see them again,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_10","text":"I want to call them by their names.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_11","text":"What should I do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_12","text":"Do you remember any distinct features? I can tell you their names.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_13","text":"Oooh, that'd be great!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_14","text":"If you tell me who they are,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_15","text":"I'll be sure to remember!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_16","text":"Tell me what you can about them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_17","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_18","text":"The first person who spoke to me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_19","text":"gave me some candy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_20","text":"It was strawberry-flavored and delicious!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_21","text":"That would be the strawberry fanatic, Diesel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_22","text":"Diesel, okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_23","text":"I'm writing it down now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_24","text":"Next,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_25","text":"I was following after an adorable calico cat,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_26","text":"and nearly ran smack into a wall,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_27","text":"but someone stopped me just before I did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_28","text":"Her gaze was a bit intense, but she had a really big smile.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_29","text":"At first, I thought she was some kind of bad guy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_30","text":"but once I got to know her, she's one of the kindest people I know!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_31","text":"That would be Drake.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_32","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_33","text":"She'll love it if you exclaim, \"Oh no, a villain!\" when you see her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_34","text":"Okay!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_35","text":"I'll be sure to do that next time I see her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_36","text":"There was also someone","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_37","text":"who went on and on about demons and chaos,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_38","text":"but I couldn't quite make sense of what she was saying.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_39","text":"I presume that's Guillotine. It's perfectly all right if you don't understand her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_40","text":"Wow,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_41","text":"you really do know everyone!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_42","text":"And...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_43","text":"Wait, there's more?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_44","text":"Yeah, I also talked to someone with huuuuge boobs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_45","text":"... Any other distinguishing characteristics?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_46","text":"Hmm... I can't really remember.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_47","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_47","text":"I'll have to pass on this one.","jump":"m_ex_n102_04_49"},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_48","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_48","text":"That could apply to so many people...","jump":"m_ex_n102_04_49"},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_49","text":"I guess there are some things you don't know, Teacher.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_50","text":"It would be easier if you can tell me something more about them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_51","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_52","text":"I'll let you know if I can recall something?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_53","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_04_54","text":"Thanks, Teacher!","jump":null}],"chat":true}